Here's a Java function that reverses a string using a character array:

```java
public static String reverseString(String input) {
    if (input == null) {
        return null;
    }
    int len = input.length();
    char[] chars = new char[len];
    for (int i = 0; i < len; i++) {
        chars[i] = input.charAt(len - 1 - i);
    }
    return new String(chars);
}
```

